   "type": "DOCUMENT",
   "isFreePreview": true,
   "description": "Khung môn học theo syllabus FLM chính thức.",
   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">SBA301 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.1</span>\n<h2>Course profile, as the university publishes it</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Integrate single page application with Spring Boot — the official numbers: credits, hours, prerequisite and the decision that issued this syllabus.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 13801 · Decision 1402/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 12/12/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">SBA301 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.1</span>\n<h2>Hồ sơ môn học, đúng như trường công bố</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Integrate single page application with Spring Boot — các con số chính thức: tín chỉ, giờ học, môn tiên quyết và quyết định ban hành syllabus.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 13801 · QĐ 1402/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 12/12/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Subject code</span><span class=\"v\">SBA301</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus name</span><span class=\"v\">Integrate single page application with Spring Boot_Tích hợp ứng dụng trang đơn với Spring Boot</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Credits</span><span class=\"v\">6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Degree level</span><span class=\"v\">Bachelor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Time allocation</span><span class=\"v\">Study hour (300h) = 90h contact hours + 145-minute final exam + 207.6h self-study</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Prerequisite</span><span class=\"v\">HSF302</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Teaching method</span><span class=\"v\">Project based learning,Problem based learning,Active learning,In-class lecture</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Scoring scale</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Minimum average to pass</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus ID</span><span class=\"v\">13801</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Decision</span><span class=\"v\">1402/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 12/12/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Approved date</span><span class=\"v\">12/12/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Sessions in the plan</span><span class=\"v\">120</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Mã môn</span><span class=\"v\">SBA301</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Tên syllabus</span><span class=\"v\">Integrate single page application with Spring Boot_Tích hợp ứng dụng trang đơn với Spring Boot</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Số tín chỉ</span><span class=\"v\">6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Bậc đào tạo</span><span class=\"v\">Bachelor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Phân bổ thời gian</span><span class=\"v\">Study hour (300h) = 90h contact hours + 145-minute final exam + 207.6h self-study</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Môn tiên quyết</span><span class=\"v\">HSF302</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Phương pháp dạy – học</span><span class=\"v\">Project based learning,Problem based learning,Active learning,In-class lecture</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Thang điểm</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Điểm trung bình tối thiểu để qua</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus ID</span><span class=\"v\">13801</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Quyết định ban hành</span><span class=\"v\">1402/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 12/12/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Ngày duyệt</span><span class=\"v\">12/12/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Số buổi trong kế hoạch</span><span class=\"v\">120</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Description (verbatim)</h3>\n<p>Upon completion of this course students shoud:<br><br>1. Understand the followings:<br><br>• ReactJS concepts for building Front-End application<br><br>• RESTful API concepts<br><br>• RESTful API using Spring Boot's built-in features and frameworks<br><br>• Security features (authentication and authorization) with RESTful API<br><br>• Handling HTTP requests and responses using Spring Boot's framework<br><br>• Error handling and exception management in Spring Boot RESTful APIs<br><br>2. Be able to:<br><br>• Build RESTful APIs using Spring Boot's built-in features and frameworks<br><br>• Implement security features with authentication and authorization<br><br>• Handle HTTP requests and responses using Spring Boot's framework<br><br>• Build Front-End application using ReactJS components<br><br>• Integrate Spring Boot with other technologies and frameworks SQL Server, MongoDB, and ReactJS<br><br>3. Be able to work in team and present group's results</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Mô tả môn học (nguyên văn)</h3>\n<p>Upon completion of this course students shoud:<br><br>1. Understand the followings:<br><br>• ReactJS concepts for building Front-End application<br><br>• RESTful API concepts<br><br>• RESTful API using Spring Boot's built-in features and frameworks<br><br>• Security features (authentication and authorization) with RESTful API<br><br>• Handling HTTP requests and responses using Spring Boot's framework<br><br>• Error handling and exception management in Spring Boot RESTful APIs<br><br>2. Be able to:<br><br>• Build RESTful APIs using Spring Boot's built-in features and frameworks<br><br>• Implement security features with authentication and authorization<br><br>• Handle HTTP requests and responses using Spring Boot's framework<br><br>• Build Front-End application using ReactJS components<br><br>• Integrate Spring Boot with other technologies and frameworks SQL Server, MongoDB, and ReactJS<br><br>3. Be able to work in team and present group's results</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13801\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13801</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13801\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13801</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
